{"book":"ezekiel","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T12:00:22.958375823Z","verse":43,"ref":"ezekiel 16:43","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":16,"translation":"Because you did not remember ⟨את⟩ the days of your youth, and you enraged me with all these things, therefore even I — look! — I have placed your way on ⟨your⟩ head, declares Adonai YHWH; and you did not do ⟨את⟩ this lewdness on top of all your abominations.","tokens":[{"surface":"יען","gloss":"Because"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"⟨that⟩"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"זכרתי","gloss":"you remembered"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the days of your youth"},{"surface":"ימי","gloss":"the days of"},{"surface":"נעוריך","gloss":"of your youth"},{"surface":"ותרגזי","gloss":"and you enraged"},{"surface":"לי","gloss":"me"},{"surface":"בכל","gloss":"with all"},{"surface":"אלה","gloss":"these things"},{"surface":"וגם","gloss":"and also"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"I"},{"surface":"הא","gloss":"look!"},{"surface":"דרכך","gloss":"your way"},{"surface":"בראש","gloss":"on your head"},{"surface":"נתתי","gloss":"I have placed"},{"surface":"נאם","gloss":"declares"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"Adonai"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"YHWH"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"and you did not"},{"surface":"עשיתי","gloss":"do"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"this lewdness"},{"surface":"הזמה","gloss":"this lewdness"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"on top of"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"all"},{"surface":"תועבתיך","gloss":"your abominations"}]}